{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0333_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7d238e26cfb92c72bb0674046c2669b4b8b6b98890d1f5d831180306ab16913f", "ja": "（先日の雑誌対談が好評だったおかげで、\n『レオ』の特集記事を組んでもらえることになった！）", "zh": "（多亏前几天的杂志访谈反响很好，对方答应为《Leo》制作专题报道了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0333_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d34852bda8d96e318671674f62f440bae30c4df2df174cb64bd3a39321e44ec2", "ja": "（みんなには早速、雑誌に掲載するアンケートに\n答えてもらっている……）", "zh": "（大家已经马上开始填写要刊登在杂志上的问卷了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0333_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "919c9f03c19fc045cb3aa3673d5fed8ce077e10282a3d0e33b054f16c3ab7cca", "ja": "{$P$}さん、おつかれさま！\n雑誌のアンケート、書いてきたよ。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦啦！\n杂志的调查问卷，我填好拿来啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0333_1003_p", "source_sha256": "0ef406313c5f0f3353b912302e48724102b0f9a6283bbd7c5493adf26f06adf9", "ja": "お、育。お疲れさま。\n何か、わからないところはなかったか？", "zh": "哦，育。辛苦了。\n有没有什么不明白的地方？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0333_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "3d377f40adf372f299af04d0a45e3a31480cde112d2bd125ecf19c44d1ec7766", "ja": "うん、だいじょうぶ！\nでも、ちょっと難しかったところはあったかも。", "zh": "嗯，没问题！\n不过，可能还是有稍微有点难的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0333_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "51756adeb17d808fc0c3335a2849873df9a05bb4e29a3cfa0d279981e35069bf", "ja": "「アイドルになる前と、なった後で、\nどんなところが変わったと思うか」ってところ。", "zh": "就是问“觉得成为偶像之前和之后，\n有哪些地方改变了”的那题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0333_1006_p", "source_sha256": "1fad7e503948f3166016daf6393f3c8e4a8d85fe9cc3c6ac6ef5cb4a73d737bb", "ja": "そうだよな。自分の変化って、\n自分自身では気づきにくいものだから。", "zh": "是啊。自己的变化，往往很难由自己察觉到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0333_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "3e97f8b629ca5c3fa0c692f8385c5ec2b417b817048888fcc7daea720eff1dd4", "ja": "うん。それでね、おかあさんに聞いてみたの。\n「わたし、どこが変わったと思う？」って。", "zh": "嗯。所以呢，我就去问了妈妈。\n问她“你觉得我哪里变了呢？”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0333_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "e15e0310d45085c0d1bd99a86a0a11b6f109734823e0057af0ef320cfe3345ce", "ja": "そしたらね、「前よりちょっと、\nお姉さんになったと思うよ」だって！", "zh": "然后妈妈说：“我觉得你比以前更像个大姐姐了。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0333_1009_p", "source_sha256": "291cc8bee9682dc374fcf3cfe1589fd4ffc9e25879cba4b643c9aac00fb1d86b", "ja": "おっ、そうか……それはよかったな！", "zh": "哦，这样啊……那就太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0333_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "f7c076cc0a8ca54b209198157fb3d26511f8abaee8e671786c878059715a50c1", "ja": "えへへ♪　あのね、わたし思うんだけど……\n変わっちゃうことって、悪いことじゃないかも？", "zh": "嘿嘿♪那个啊，我觉得吧……\n改变也许不是什么坏事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0333_1011_030iku", "source_sha256": "c1edf01ed2c5bdaa6308fcc79539e140a730ac4d5dd6f4ca98d43419d07c69bb", "ja": "おかあさんも言ってたんだ。「変わったってことは、\n成長したってことかもしれないよ」って。", "zh": "妈妈也这么说过。“发生变化，也许就意味着成长了。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0333_1012_030iku", "source_sha256": "70f690f519b4be683747a8f2cf1cd72fa518804abfe6f4c5dfa214ccdc6464d5", "ja": "だから、わたしも成長できてるってこと\nなのかなって……。", "zh": "所以，我是不是也在成长呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0333_1013_p", "source_sha256": "a71a4062acd1292b8345aa5f7daa935d85828f7f80f02f97f84d91f6564cb47f", "ja": "そうだな。確かに育は、成長したと思うよ。\nこれからもきっと、どんどん成長していくだろうな！", "zh": "是啊。育确实成长了不少。\n今后肯定也会不断成长的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0333_1014_030iku", "source_sha256": "11c8da07e276629653091d97f1704c0127b211063e2189e9ed44226551d1e374", "ja": "うん！　わたし、もっともっと成長したい！\nいっぱい頑張って、成長して……。", "zh": "嗯！我还想继续不断成长！\n我要更加努力，不断成长……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0333_1015_030iku", "source_sha256": "35d33b9ecde1ecb0268ec02c9654102620a9e92db5594b1649f3b38ed12bb5fc", "ja": "いつか、{$P$}さんに\n追いついちゃうんだから♪　見ててね！", "zh": "总有一天，我会赶上\n{$P$}先生的♪　看着我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
